{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","裂地震摔"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Quake Slam"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","将敌人原地砸下或将自身后方的敌人砸回自身所在位置，使目标及周围敌人眩晕。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucca slams an enemy in place or to his original tile, stunning both the target and nearby enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择相邻敌人释放时，将其击飞并抓取目标原地砸下；选择比自己更靠后的敌人释放时，卢卡会冲向该敌人将其击飞并砸回卢卡原本所处位置。砸地会对抓取目标周围1格敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并使命中的敌人眩晕2秒。施法期间卢卡免疫控制。自动释放时优先选择比自己更靠后的敌人释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When targeting an adjacent enemy, Lucca knocks them into the air and then slams them down in place. When targeting an enemy located closer to his allied backline, Lucca will rush at them and slam them back to his original tile. The slam deals 200% + 20% ATK damage to the target and their adjacent enemies, stunning them for 2s. Lucca is immune to control effects while casting this skill, and if auto cast is enabled, he will prioritize targets that are closer to his allied backline."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":83,"end":89,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":247,"end":253,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":79,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":243,"end":257,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 210% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{