en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","破敌强击"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Ruthless Ram"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成打断效果并使其缴械，同时自身获得护盾。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucca gains a shield, then interrupts and disarms an enemy."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身获得护盾，护盾能够抵御的伤害量相当于自身340% + 3%的护甲以及340% + 3%的魔抗之和，持续8秒，随后猛击一名敌人，造成150% + 15% ATK伤害，附带打断效果并使目标缴械4秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lucca gains a shield that absorbs damage equal to 340% + 3% of his Phys DEF plus 340% + 3% of his Magic DEF for 8s. He then shoulders into an enemy, dealing 150% + 15% ATK damage, interrupting them, and disarming them for 4s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":40,"end":45,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":71,"end":77,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":85,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":161,"end":167,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":86,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"},{"start":94,"end":96,"tooltip_key":"keyword:disarm"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":157,"end":171,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":180,"end":192,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"},{"start":203,"end":212,"tooltip_key":"keyword:disarm"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至自身360% + 3%的护甲以及360% + 3%的魔抗之和。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 360% + 3% Phys DEF plus 360% + 3% Magic DEF."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":58,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至自身380% + 3%的护甲以及380% + 3%的魔抗之和。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 380% + 3% Phys DEF plus 380% + 3% Magic DEF."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":58,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至自身400% + 3%的护甲以及400% + 3%的魔抗之和。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 400% + 3% Phys DEF plus 400% + 3% Magic DEF."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":58,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","激昂战吼"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Courageous Call"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","移除自身可驱散的负面状态，并使自己受到伤害降低。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucca removes dispellable debuffs from himself and reduces his damage taken."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","振臂挺胸发出怒吼，移除自身所有可驱散的负面状态，并使自己在接下来的5秒内受到伤害减少25% + 2%。当卢卡处于可被驱散的控制状态下时也可以释放该技能。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lucca unleashes a fierce roar, removing all dispellable debuffs from himself and reducing his damage taken by 25% + 2% for the next 5s. This skill can be cast while Lucca is under dispellable control effects."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":113,"end":118,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害减少效果提升至28% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 28% + 2%."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害减少效果提升至31% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 31% + 2%."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害减少效果提升至35% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 35% + 2%."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身最大生命值。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases max HP during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升17%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases max HP by 17% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升23%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases max HP by 23% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升29%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases max HP by 29% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","不动铁盟"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Unshakeable Ties"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","卢卡处于稳定状态并且能够受到布阵在后方友军的激励。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucca remains steadfast and gains a shield for each ally placed behind him."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","卢卡下盘稳固，战斗中始终处于稳定，并且会受到来自身后友军的激励：战斗开始时每有1名友军布阵在卢卡身后相邻位置，卢卡获得相当于该友军220%攻击力的护盾。提供护盾的友军提高5%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lucca maintains a solid fighting stance, remaining steadfast during the battle. For each ally placed in an adjacent tile behind him when a battle starts, he gains a shield equal to 220% of the ally's ATK. Allies supporting Lucca also receive a 5% boost to their ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":51,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至友军240%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 240% of the ally's ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","若激励卢卡的友军不少于2名，“破敌强击”的攻击范围改为前方1格扇形范围。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","If at least 2 allies are placed to support Lucca, expands Ruthless Ram's area of effect to a 1-tile arc in front."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至友军260%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 260% of the ally's ATK."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放技能“激昂战吼”时自身回复生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucca recovers HP when casting Courageous Call."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放技能“激昂战吼”时，自身回复15% HP生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lucca recovers 15% HP HP when casting Courageous Call."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":15,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","布阵在卢卡身后的相邻友军获得卢卡30%的双抗。每场战斗一次，当这些友军受到伤害时，卢卡立即对符合条件的伤害来源释放一次无消耗的终极技能。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Lucca increases the Phys & Magic DEF of adjacent allies placed behind him during Battle Preparation by 30%. In battle, when these allies take damage, Lucca immediately casts his Ultimate on a valid target that dealt the damage, without consuming Energy. This effect can trigger once per battle."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","血薇金腰带"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Carmine Belt"]]}